Blockquote lazy continuation

```
> quoted
continued
.
<blockquote><p>quoted
continued</p></blockquote>
```

```
> a
>> b
c
.
<blockquote>
  <p>a</p>
  <blockquote><p>b
c</p></blockquote>
</blockquote>
```

```
> a
> > b
c
.
<blockquote>
  <p>a</p>
  <blockquote><p>b
c</p></blockquote>
</blockquote>
```

```
> quoted
- item
.
<blockquote><p>quoted
- item</p></blockquote>
```

```
> # h
- item
.
<blockquote>
  <h1 id="h">h</h1>
</blockquote>
<ul>
  <li>item</li>
</ul>
```
